WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.201 --> 00:00:16.478
Coby: Come on, Mark!

2
00:00:16.478 --> 00:00:22.111
We have to follow Mr. Lenny!

3
00:00:22.112 --> 00:00:32.076
Mark: He's probably meeting the person who wrote the note!

4
00:00:32.077 --> 00:00:45.208
Mark: He's crossing the street.

5
00:00:45.209 --> 00:00:50.510
Mark: Now he's stopping at the store.

6
00:00:50.511 --> 00:00:53.559
Coby: He's turning around.

7
00:00:53.559 --> 00:00:55.907
And now he's—

8
00:00:55.908 --> 00:01:02.345
Mark: Coming right at us! Oh no!

9
00:01:02.346 --> 00:01:07.046
Mr. Lenny: Coby and Mark! What's going on?

10
00:01:07.047 --> 00:01:12.523
Mr. Lenny: You two have been following me all afternoon.

11
00:01:12.524 --> 00:01:16.534
Coby: We were trying to help you!

12
00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:22.456
Mark: I told Coby it wasn't a good idea!

13
00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:26.336
Coby: We found a note in your office.

14
00:01:26.337 --> 00:01:31.702
Mark: And it sounded like you were in danger.

15
00:01:31.703 --> 00:01:34.737
Mr. Lenny: And what did this note say?

16
00:01:34.738 --> 00:01:36.071
Coby: Go after dark . . .

17
00:01:36.072 --> 00:01:37.455
Bring my money

18
00:01:37.456 --> 00:01:40.475
. . . Or else!

19
00:01:40.476 --> 00:01:47.221
Mr. Lenny: Ha-ha! Ha-ha!

20
00:01:47.222 --> 00:01:49.691
Mark: Why are you laughing?

21
00:01:49.692 --> 00:01:53.872
Mr. Lenny: Because . . . that note was from my son.

22
00:01:53.873 --> 00:01:58.741
Mr. Lenny: He really wants to go to the movie tonight.

23
00:01:58.742 --> 00:02:01.430
Coby: You mean Movies After Dark?

24
00:02:01.431 --> 00:02:06.468
Mr. Lenny: Yep. And my son said he'd pay for it with his allowance.

25
00:02:06.469 --> 00:02:09.392
Coby: Then what's in the bag?

26
00:02:09.393 --> 00:02:14.134
Mr. Lenny: Nothing. It was free at the bank so I took one.

27
00:02:14.135 --> 00:02:19.032
Coby: Sorry. I guess I got too excited about my spy kit.

28
00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:21.485
Mark: We shouldn't have been spying.

29
00:02:21.486 --> 00:02:23.894
But we were trying to help.

30
00:02:23.895 --> 00:02:51.811
Mr. Lenny: Hmm . . . Help, huh?

31
00:02:51.812 --> 00:03:01.751
Mr. Lenny: See, Coby. You can help me—with the Lost and Found!
